[
  {
    "text": "Friendship is born at that moment when one man says to another \"What! You too? I thought that no one but myself . . .",
    "author": "C. S. Lewis",
    "index": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm so fast last night I cut the light switch and was in bed before the room was dark.",
    "author": "Muhammad Ali",
    "index": null
  },
  {
    "text": "He who has a why to live can bear with almost any how.",
    "author": "Viktor Frankl",
    "index": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Football is not a matter of life and death. It's much more important than that.",
    "author": "Bill Shankly",
    "index": null
  },
  {
    "text": "No man will make a great business who wants to do it all himself, or to get all the credit of doing it.",
    "author": "Andrew Carnegie",
    "index": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The man who dies thus rich dies disgraced",
    "author": "Andrew Carnegie",
    "index": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Success is peace of mind which is a direct result of self-satisfaction in knowing you made the effort to become the best of which you are capable.",
    "author": "John Wooden",
    "index": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Talent is God-given; be humble. Fame is man-given; be thankful. Conceit is self-given; be careful.",
    "author": "John Wooden",
    "index": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The main ingredient of stardom is the rest of the team.",
    "author": "John Wooden",
    "index": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Don't pray when it rains if you don't pray when the sun shines.",
    "author": "Satchel Paige",
    "index": null
  },
  {
    "text": "There's a lot of blood, sweat and guts between dreams and success.",
    "author": "Bear Bryant",
    "index": null
  }
]